OL,3,GNEWSA'Striking' WW1 memorial unveiled
OL,4,Ain village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "striking" living memorial to
OL,7,Fcommemorate fallen soldiers from World
OL,8,FWar One has been unveiled.
OL,10,FFifty-nine trees representing the men
OL,11,Fkilled from Martock and Bower Hinton in
OL,12,FSomerset were planted in 2021, and now
OL,13,Fa stone and knitted poppy installation
OL,14,Fhave been added to complete the
OL,15,Fmonument in Martock, Somerset.
OL,17,FAfter an appeal was launched earlier
OL,18,Fthis year, people from Martock knitted
OL,19,For crocheted thousands of poppies,
OL,20,Fwhich have been laid out at the
OL,21,Frecreation ground.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
