OL,3,GNEWSA'Striking' WW1 memorial unveiled
OL,4,Ain village
OL,5,
OL,6,FLesley Isaac, from the village's poppy
OL,7,Fproject, said: "It looks absolutely
OL,8,Fstunning and it's very striking and I
OL,9,Fthink the main thing is it's a real
OL,10,Fcommunity project."
